Track 2: Kael's Carte Blanche
- Story & Context: Kael Thorne, driven by the pulsating revelations from Nico's discovery, spent sleepless nights at the console of his Juno-60, attempting to translate the film's hidden languages, confessing to Elara that the 'silent' footage wasn't mute at all, but rather screaming. He saw patterns in the frame decay, intricate tribal patterns appearing on the blank leader tape, and believed the true 'map' was in the glitches between scenes. "My mind's a map, tearing at the seams, trying to trace these phantom coastlines."
